i have waited for this to happen since  july 3rd 2020 two years and 67 chapters  ago where ichiro oda first introduced us  to yamato son of kaido self-declared  kozuki odin and one of the most fun and  awesome characters in all of one piece  and now with the release of chapter 1051  i'm gonna take a real risk and declare  that it is now official that yamato is  going to be the 11th straw hat that will  join luffy's quest to become king of the  pirates and find the one piece i've been  praying for this to happen for so long  and just couldn't help but jumping  around the room grinning when yamato  finally introduced herself to the rest  of the straw hat crew also just to get  it out of the way i will refer to yamato  as a she in this video because i  personally think yamato isn't  identifying herself as a man like kiko  or izodu as a woman but rather she wants  to be odin for what he represented and  stood for i think a man that gave her  hopes strength and courage in a lonely  and painful childhood that she embraced  as a sort of mental shield to not break  under kaido's tyranny being odin for  yamato seems to be a value and  personality based thing to me it's  something that she will actually have to  learn to drop as she will go and travel  with the straw hats to accept herself  and her own strength trying to be  someone else i think is actually a real  character flaw that oda sensei actively  gave her that she will need to overcome  because yamato has as we know already an  incredibly strong will and personality  of her own that is quite unique and  distinct from odin if anything i think  her real self is a lot closer to luffy  actually i think and apart from odin's  ideology i personally think she very  clearly embraces her femininity and so i  will refer to her as she at least until  we get any other evidence to the  contrary i hope that makes sense but  with uh that out of the way here's why i  think that yamato is and always has been  the perfect candidate to join the straw  hat crew and how she will make the straw  hats journey even more enjoyable to  follow than it already is i think it's  really really easy to see that oda  sensei had a lot of fun developing and  writing yamato into the story i like to  think that the idea for this character  has been lying around ready somewhere in  his draw for a long long time where he  was just itching to finally reveal her  now even though character writing is oda  sensei's absolute supreme discipline  yamato stood out as something special to  me right from the start with every  single chapter and every single panel  she was in we learned so much about her  personality her fears and hopes and what  she stands and fights for her dream is  not only connected to luffy it literally  is traveling with the straw hats and  seeing the real world outside wono for  the very first time with her own eyes  you know how luffy liberated every  single straw hat that joined the crew  from some sort of prison either literal  or mental zorro from the navy base nami  from arlong sanji from his sense of  worthlessness broke from his loneliness  jimby from freaking impul down and he  liberates yamato from both her physical  chains that had forced her to stay on  monophysically but also from her  father's tyrannical rule alongside with  the other people of wano what i'm  probably most excited about is the  dynamic that yamato will undoubtedly  bring to the crew overall let me know if  you feel the same way but to me her  character brings back a ton of pre-time  skip energy a true powerhouse with the  same nativity and enthusiasm of early  luffy everything she sees will be new  and awesome to her seeing the sunny  riding on it on the ocean meeting new  people fighting enemies outside of mono  i can absolutely see yamato in true odin  fashion running out with a grin  attacking random pirate ships and just  like luffy talking to and exploring  everyone and everything she sees  just think how awesome her chemistry  with the crew will be even though she's  arguably one of the most powerful  characters in the story she will be  eager to see chopper create medicine be  the ultimate audience for all of usopp's  lies help robin with the pony glyphs  through odin's diary be a true sparring  partner for zorro sanji and brook of  course already love her anyways and i  don't really see how she wouldn't get  along with nami and so i really like to  think that yamato will refresh all of  our own experiences with the crew as  well so yeah chemistry is the most  important factor for me personally when  it comes to any new straw hat but of  course power plays a real role as well  but do we  even need to talk about that  yamato was going head to head with kaido  alone for quite a while while luffy was  out like i really don't want to rank her  among the straw hats maybe zoro is  stronger maybe she is but i'm not sure  anyone beside luffy would have been able  to do that and so with yamato we  basically got a mini kaido joining the  crew she has been trained by the yonko  knows all his moves with his club can  use advanced conquest hockey and will be  the third zone fruit to join the crew  with her mythical imo inonomi that even  gives her ice powers i mean mini aokiji  on top as well i guess  not only does yamato have a ton of room  to grow and develop as a person  traveling with luffy and kobe as i  talked about earlier but there's still  quite a lot of unclear things about who  she really is as far as we know she does  in fact seem to be kaido's actual child  but we don't know why kaido had a kitten  to begin with and who yamato's mother  might be and so really no matter from  what angle i'm looking at this i  couldn't think of anyone better to  become part of the crew of a new emperor  that will be an invaluable asset in the  terrifying and dangerous fights and  trials that are yet to come i'm also  really interested what yamato's bounty's  gonna be once the new wanted posters  arrive it will definitely be more than  mine my current one is 59 million 100  berries for each of you who is  subscribed so our first priority right  now as a crew together is to overtake at  least this terrible man here treble who  despite his constantly running nose  somehow has a 99 million buried bounty  on his head so please help me overtake  him by subscribing also i absolutely  love tama's reaction to yamato telling  the crew that she will sail with them  look at this panel it would be  absolutely awesome honestly to have her  on board as well after all she and  yamato both hoped to join ace one day  and thomas flashback during this chapter  made the entire thing even more  emotional than it already was i mean we  already got toko's memories of yasu and  their poverty growing up and now thomas  hits just as hard if not harder we see  her losing her parents and trying to  make a living selling the same hats that  she showed ace how to make at least she  had her puppy komainu by her side which  does make the entire thing somewhat more  bearable to read until finally tengoyama  steps in to take her in i'm actually  still pretty convinced that he will turn  out to be someone who we've seen before  somewhere one of the former daimyos or  some other important person from the  past i'm also really curious to find out  who he is and whether that entire tengu  thing with the mask and the wings is a  fashion choice or a devil fruit power  maybe but as if ecstasy about yamato and  sadness and relief for tama weren't  enough for my poor heart in one chapter  oda sensei had to throw in awe and shock  as well because finally finally finally  we get to see momo's 28 year old self  and oh boy  momo in the shogun's kimono with the  giant kazuki crest flowing long black  hair and a determined look on his face  is so so much more than what i ever  expected he looks absolutely badass  there's no other way of saying it really  is there like comparing this kid's mom  man giving a fierce speech to his people  comparing that to the mobile we first  met on punk hazards like momo had by far  the most underrated character arc  throughout all of juana what say his  change has been absolutely incredible  and his reunion with his sister who also  has suffered through so so much in the  past is truly heartwarming to see here  as well honestly after the last two  chapters did leave the end of the raid  feel a bit unresolved and open seeing  momo like this seeing tama and toko  being freed from their pain and everyone  cheering it felt like an immensely  satisfactory ending to the battle even  if there might still be more fighting to  be done in wano when the arc does still  seem far from over yet i think but most  importantly we now have yamato my  personal best girl in one piece finally  join the ranks of the crew giving the  straw hats three powerful zone devil  fruit users and if you want to know  whether luffy yamato and chopper are  even amongst the best 5 zone devil  fruits you really shouldn't skip this  video right here
 

